The project has evolved beyond a single book or page.  
The hierarchy should be made explicit:

```
world/site ::
  The Observatory

expedition 001 ::
  A Field Guide for an Alien Learning to Listen

transmission 001 ::
  The Invitation to Speak

future transmissions ::
  The Joke With No Owner
  The Boundary Debate Society
  Seven Pebbles
  ...
```

The Observatory is the container.

It may hold:

```
transmissions
findings
field instruments
fragments from Zee's world
expedition logs
future experiments
```

Constraint:

```
platform serves narrative
narrative does not become filler for platform
```

