## Product Direction

The current interactive chapter demonstrates a strong reusable grammar:

```
encounter
  → plausible response
  → consequence
  → intention/effect distinction
  → next burden
  → revisability
  → perspective attunement
  → optional reflection
  → finding
```

Its strongest unique instruments are:

```
Relational Field State
Next Burden
Perspective Attunement
Revisability
Field Note
```

The chapter does not classify the reader.

It observes:

```
what attention noticed
what the response allowed next
where labor moved
whether interpretation remained revisable
```

This is the correct model for later experiments as well.

---

## Expansion Control

Observed creative tendency:

```
story
  → platform
  → observatory
  → nexus
  → ephemeral rooms
  → mail relay
  → AI correspondent
  → interspecies listening simulator
```

All are compatible with the world.

Not all belong in the next implementation cycle.

Priority remains:

```
1. stabilize Observatory container
2. complete reusable chapter architecture
3. publish Chapter Two
4. test whether the grammar travels
5. deepen Zee / Mara / world through story
6. activate new systems only when narrative evidence requests them
```

Protection phrase:

> The strange parts may be expansive. The infrastructure may remain boring.

