## Relay Finding

The Observatory Relay fits the project when framed as:

```
not chatbot
not authority
not verdict engine
not hidden-motive detector

relay :=
  reflective translator
  pattern observer
  burden cartographer
  uncertainty preserver
  source of one better question
```

A future Relay response may contain:

```
what was described
two realities that may coexist
where burden moved
one question from Zee's world
one optional Earth-language continuation
field status: incomplete
```

Automation should begin only in:

```
draft review mode
```

Human review precedes automatic sending.

---

## Community Finding

The strongest continuation from private story into community is not a comment section.

It is a temporary commons:

```
Passing Constellation :=
  travelers meet around one inquiry
  speak / listen / resonate
  no permanent social score
  no winner
  no required disclosure
  each carries only what they intentionally keep
```

The Observatory helps one traveler notice.

The Nexus may later help travelers notice one another.

The home world may return patterns as questions, never as rankings.

