## Transmission Conclusion

```
continuity confidence :: high

essence loss risk      :: low
scope expansion risk   :: high
tone drift risk        :: manageable through fold
ethical drift risk     :: low if invariants remain authoritative
technical drift risk   :: low if chapter data stays separate from renderer
```

The project’s enduring center is not aliens, instruments, websites, or AI.

It is this:

> Information may be present without being allowed to matter.

And its practice is this:

> Pause long enough for another person’s reality to become possible.

---

## Carry Forward

```
do not search for guilty people
notice closed processes

do not demand certainty
preserve enough openness for information to enter

do not confuse kindness with reception
ask what changed

do not build every possible future
publish the next finding
```

